        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an eerie silence, a place where childhood dreams have turned into eternal nightmares. You are a paranormal investigator, drawn by dark rumors of an abandoned school built on the ruins of an old orphanage where, decades ago, children died of a mysterious illness and abuse. You come for answers, but find only the remnants of innocence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These walls once filled with children's laughter, but now their echoes are distorted by suffering. The souls of dead children are still here. They are not evil, but their games never stopped. And now they want to play with you. The orphanage has become an eerie dollhouse, where every toy is a glimpse from the past, every creak a whisper, and every corner harbors forgotten pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Psychological Horror: Explore a terrifying atmosphere where the line between reality and madness blurs. Witness unexplained phenomena, where sweet childhood objects turn into sources of unbearable horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Puzzles: Solve intricate riddles based on childhood games and the orphanage's tragic history. Each solved puzzle brings you closer to the truth, but also plunges you deeper into the abyss of despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense Jump Scares: Be prepared for sudden and shocking moments that will make your heart beat faster. Invisible forces, animated toys, and shadows lurking around the corner will keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a game; it's a plunge into the deepest fears, where childhood innocence turns into the most terrifying nightmare. Are you ready to play their games?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll need to find keys and open locked rooms. A first-person game with horror elements. Explore the bus station and its rooms, collecting batteries for your flashlight. Darkness can hide various secrets.</p>",
